ttps://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-schertenleib-gilda.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/c595a1440675b3fe2741b458c189423b/schertenleib-gilda\">Kontakt</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Tania Vanetti","role":"Grafikdesign","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-vanetti-tania.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/4c04d69f8fa1396264ade03bf00d7da6/vanetti-tania\">Kontakt</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Barbara Vogt","role":"Institutionelle Kommunikation","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/press-vogt-barbara.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/678d5643a34e734b4c344c19ad7f1717/vogt-barbara\">Kontakt</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Accademia di architettura","role":"","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/","html":"<p>Für die institutionelle Kommunikation der Accademia di architettura koordiniert sich der Dienst mit: </p> <ul> <li>Arch. <a href=\"http://search.usi.ch/it/persone/823d5a1e8522f40c457342b1ccc76fac/della-torre-marco\">Marco Della Torre</a>, Koordinator der Direktion der Accademia di architettura </li> <li><a href=\"http://search.usi.ch/it/persone/f08daab07cf9f6e6f5464330ece39ba6/dandrea-diana\">Diana D'Andrea</a>, Sekretariat der Direktion der Accademia di architettura</li> </ul>"},{"t":"html","html":"<p><strong>Architekturakademie</strong></p> <p>Für alle Kommunikationsaktivitäten rund um die Architekturakademie arbeitet der Dienst eng zusammen mit:</p> <ul> <li>Arch. <a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/823d5a1e8522f40c457342b1ccc76fac/della-torre-marco\">Marco Della Torre</a>, Koordinator der Direktion der Architekturakademie</li> <li><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/f08daab07cf9f6e6f5464330ece39ba6/dandrea-diana\">Diana D'Andrea</a>, Sekretariat der Direktion der Architekturakademie</li> <li><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/e39c1ca8db984128c7fb92eea3823a75/canepa-alberto\">Alberto Canepa</a>, Grafik und Web der Architekturakademie</li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Institutionelle Kommunikation","href":"/en/university/info/press"},{"label":"Medienmitteilungen","href":"/en/university/info/press/press-releases"},{"label":"Die USI kennenlernen","href":"/en/university/info/press/get-to-know-us"},{"label":"Einführung","href":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us"},{"label":"Die USI in den sozialen Medien","href":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us/social-media"},{"label":"Die USI in den Medien","href":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us/press-review"},{"label":"In Kontakt bleiben","href":"/en/university/info/press/follow-us/stay-in-touch"},{"label":"Institutionelle Publikationen","href":"/en/university/info/press/publications"},{"label":"Informationen für die USI-Gemeinschaft","href":"/en/university/info/press/info-for-the-community"},{"label":"Dienst für institutionelle Kommunikation","href":"/en/university/info/press/about/service"},{"label":"USI Newsroom","href":"/en/university/info/press/about/newsroom"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/press/about/service","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:41:54.715Z","translated":true}